	(text "IDE bus through four SN74CB3T3245 FET bus switches: A side to the PGA2350, B side to the IDE header.\nOE# low = connected. They cap what the RP2350 sees at about 3.3 V and isolate it when unpowered (Ioff).\nNo pull-ups or pull-downs on the bus: the host provides them. IORDY stays open drain."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a297d3b4-1633-5ad2-af81-cd6c93d0ba57")
	)
